      "latin": "Lā uqsimu bihāżal-balad(i).",
      "translation_id": "Aku bersumpah demi negeri ini (Makkah),",
      "translation_en": "I swear by this city, Makkah -",
      "audio": {
        "01": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/090001.mp3",
